From 57cb90c00748ad21aac46d31c2f775eba3fa956d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miller Bath <millerzbath@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:39:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: send dropped folders to remote terminals and show
 each transfer

Files and folders dropped on another machine's terminal go one at a time
with hc put --progress; a card over the pane lists them (queued, a bar
with %, done or failed) and goes 10 s after the last one. An hc without
--progress still sends files, without the %.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
